{"version":1,"key":"card:464","content":{"id":464,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要指定超类，可在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"class","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中的类名后加上超类名，并将其用圆括号括起"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"class Filter:\n    def init(self):\n      self.blocked = []\n    def filter(self, sequence):\n      return [x for x in sequence if x not in self.blocked]\n\n\nclass SPAMFilter(Filter): # SPAMFilter是Filter的子类\n    def init(self): # 重写超类Filter的方法init\n      self.blocked = ['SPAM']","language":"py","uuid":"6d72fc36-803e-4ed3-ae58-280bf14108ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要确定一个类是否是另一个类的子类，可使用内置方法 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"issubclass","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> issubclass(SPAMFilter, Filter)\nTrue\n>>> issubclass(Filter, SPAMFilter)\nFalse","language":"py","uuid":"45f23c95-a1e8-415a-b5de-0b4e2bf8f773","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你有一个类，并想知道它的基类，可访问其特殊属性 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"__bases__","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> SPAMFilter.__bases__\n(<class __main__.Filter at 0x171e40>,)\n>>> Filter.__bases__\n(<class 'object'>,)","language":"py","uuid":"c3cb2467-0a36-4f22-ad16-cbabd2e46df3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要确定对象是否是特定类的实例，可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"isinstance","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> s = SPAMFilter()\n>>> isinstance(s, SPAMFilter)\nTrue\n>>> isinstance(s, Filter)\nTrue\n>>> isinstance(s, str)\nFalse","language":"py","uuid":"f82c08ef-5979-4f11-aa55-8df7e242352a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"isinstance","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通常不是良好的做法，依赖多态在任何情况下都是更好的选择。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你要获悉对象属于哪个类，可使用属性 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"__class__","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> s.__class__\n<class __main__.SPAMFilter at 0x1707c0>","language":"py","uuid":"1b946aa9-fe2d-4b0b-a133-09e92b29cefb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"type(s)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来获悉其所属的类。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"继承多个类"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"class Calculator:\n    def calculate(self, expression):\n      self.value = eval(expression)\n\n\nclass Talker:\n    def talk(self):\n      print('Hi, my value is', self.value)\n\n\nclass TalkingCalculator(Calculator, Talker):\n    pass","language":"py","uuid":"55fa6065-e7cd-4c3e-9bbd-82521a2afe5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除非万不得已，否则应避免使用多重继承，因为在有些情况下，它可能带来意外的“并发症”。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用多重继承时，有一点务必注意：如果多个超类以不同的方式实现了同一个方法（即有多个同名方法），必须在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"class","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句中小心排列这些超类，因为位于"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前面的类的方法将覆盖位于后面的类的方法"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["Python/类"],"createTime":1719226234025,"updateTime":1767362191164,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767362191164}}